See CLAUDE.md.

That file is the single authority for this repo's architecture notes, module
boundaries, and engine guardrails; Cursor reads it from here.

This file used to be a full copy of CLAUDE.md. It drifted — by 2026-09-10 it was
three weeks stale and missing six sections, including the two that exist to
prevent silent corruption (the `r_decals` mid-demo rule, which shifts every later
frame ordinal by +1, and the pipeline-owned command list). It also still mandated
a task-completion return-payload format that is no longer wanted. Two authorities
that disagree is worse than one, so this is a pointer now. Don't re-fork it.
